Description: FPV drone streaming portal (MediaMTX + FastAPI + Vue)
 Web portal for low-latency FPV drone streaming on a Raspberry Pi:
 MediaMTX (WebRTC/WHEP) fed by an ffmpeg V4L2 capture pipeline, a
 FastAPI backend for stream settings and hardware monitoring, and a
 Vue frontend served by nginx.

